BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Phonebank for Randy Villegas!
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260823T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260823T150000
UID:bf163375a429185f1aa53ee5f1d0fef5@mobilize.us
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mobilize-uploads-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/u
 ploads/event/RVGen_20260731170336396292.jpeg
DESCRIPTION:Join the Villegas for Congress team for our Sunday phonebanks.
  We'll be calling voters in District 22 to earn their votes for the Novemb
 er 3rd election. Each phone bank will begin with a training on how to use 
 our phonebanking system and to review our script. If you have never phoneb
 anked before that’s okay\, we'll make sure you’re comfortable with eve
 rything before we start calling. Please join us and bring a friend!
LOCATION:Virtual event
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/randyvillegas/event/1000801/
X-SOURCE:Indivisible Yolo (Mobilize)
END:VEVENT
